 been released by the \nCentral Government to the States/UTs under PMAY -G as on \n20.07.2023.  The State -wise details of number of houses \nconstructed during each of the last five years is given in Annexure. \n  \n***** \n\nAnnexure \n  \nSTATEMENT IN REPLY TO PART (a) & (c) OF LOK SABHA UNSTARRED QUESTION NO. 912 TO BE ANSWERED ON \n25.07.2023 REGARDING PMAY-G IN UTTAR PRADESH \n  \nState-wise performance details number of houses sanctioned and constructed under Pradhan  Mantri Awaas Yojana- \nGramin (PMAY-G) in the country during each of the last five years i.e. from financial year 2018 -19 to 2022-23 \n(units in nos.) \nS. \nNo. State Name \n2018-19 2019-20 2020-21 2021-22 2022-23 \nHouses \nSanctioned \nHouses \nCompleted \nHouses \nSanctioned \nHouses \nCompleted \nHouses \nSanctioned \nHouses \nCompleted \nHouses \nSanctioned \nHouses \nCompleted \nHouses \nSanctioned \nHouses \nCompleted \n1 \nARUNACHAL \nPRADESH 1,063 85 2,135 747 19,038 2,417 11,044 992 2,707 9,344 \n2 ASSAM 40,378 1,59,017 1,79,834 84,009 1,50,039 1,30,879 2,16,359 1,17,694 10,55,005 10,09,151 \n3 BIHAR 4,25,640 5,81,827 10,43,896 3,76,216 6,25,357 9,42,615 8,99,367 5,08,362 1,33,110 11,47,076 \n4 CHHATTISGARH 2,89,909 3,41,378 1,50,952 34,587 1,57,534 59,684 371 23,289 81,375 33,575 \n5 GOA 107 22 53 3 32 87 47 19 18 12 \n6 GUJARAT 26,313 83,096 1,01,344 35,589 21,347 50,742 1,07,420 77,263 1,48,714 65,562 \n7 HARYANA 2,487 5,961 113 6,670 61 1,215 3,317 263 5,114 5,408 \n8 \nHIMACHAL \nPRADESH 817 3,096 1,038 447 4,001 605 2,729 1,884 794 3,654 \n9 \nJAMMU AND \nKASHMIR 17,672 13,850 38,615 5,016 64,045 21,569 55,862 42,515 7,818 79,271 \n10 JHARKHAND 1,37,303 2,72,678 3,02,025 1,56,974 3,61,648 2,35,011 3,90,226 2,95,036 11,590 3,63,314 \n11 KERALA 926 6,519 738 779 3,330 686 12,615 2,440 1,633 8,825 \n12 \nMADHYA \nPRADESH 3,04,759 7,00,447 3,78,384 2,72,863 7,56,726 2,61,254 4,90,326 6,06,303 7,54,552 10,58,374 \n13 MAHARASHTRA 78,844 2,01,968 2,47,825 92,276 2,92,105 1,81,756 1,17